<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Argentine telcom cos started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Argentine telcom cos started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs initiated coverage of Telefonica Argentina SA and Telecom Argentina SA and added the stocks to the recommended list, a Goldman source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
